Z||000000||rodmcneill||11-08-2001||01:26 AM||||It bugs me when I find a nice Fiero on Autotrader.com but the ad. does not list even the State the vehicle is in. I think this should be in their ad. I have to look up the area code in the front of the telephone book to find an approx. location. I don't mind calling them but it is usually late at night when I am searching. Is there some kind of site I can punch in area codes to get locations?||||reg||5
